<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Our Mission - Transforming Trading Mindsets | The Saran Trader</title>
    <meta name="description"
        content="Learn about the core mission of The Saran Trader: to transform trading from a gambling mindset to a professional business approach.">

    <!-- CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/output.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/images/favicon.jpg">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/favicon.jpg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>

<body class="bg-brand-navy text-white font-sans antialiased">
    <%- include('../partials/layout_wrapper_top', { pageTitle: 'Our Mission', wrapperBg: 'bg-brand-navy' }) %>

    <main id="main-content" class="<%= standardTopPadding %> pb-20">
        <!-- Mission Hero -->
        <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center mb-20 animate-fade-in">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-6">
                Our <span class="text-brand-gold italic">Mission</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                Empowering individuals to treat trading as a professional business through discipline, data, and mental mastery.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Mission Content -->
        <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mb-32">
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
                <div class="space-y-8">
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold border-l-4 border-brand-gold pl-4 text-white">The Core Objective</h2>
                        <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                            The Saran Trader ka mission bilkul clear hai: <span class="text-brand-gold font-bold italic">Trading ko gambling nahi, business ki tarah dekha jaye.</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid gap-6">
                        <div class="flex gap-4 p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-gold/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-brand-gold shrink-0">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-xl"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Education Over Hype</h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Hum tips dene mein nahi, aapko self-dependent trader banane mein believe karte hain.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex gap-4 p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 shrink-0">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie text-xl"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Sustainable Growth</h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Overtrading ko rokna aur capital protect karna humara primary focus hai.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex gap-4 p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 shrink-0">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-xl"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Risk Mastery</h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Har trade ke peeche ek solid risk management plan hona chahiye.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="relative">
                    <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-brand-gold/10 bg-slate-900/50 p-2">
                        <img src="/images/our_mission.jpeg" alt="Mission Vision" class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl block">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA Section -->
        <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-32">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-gold to-brand-accent rounded-3xl p-12 text-center text-brand-navy shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-6">Align With Our Mission?</h2>
                <p class="text-lg opacity-90 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
                    If you are tired of shortcuts and ready for the professional path, join us today.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="<%= links.platform.courses %>" class="px-8 py-4 bg-brand-navy text-white rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
                        Start Learning
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/layout_wrapper_bottom') %>

    <script src="/javascripts/main.js" defer></script>
</body>

</html>
